<title>CHINA: China seen not starting family car before 2005.</title>
<headline>China seen not starting family car before 2005.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China was not expected to begin building its family car programme before the year 2005, Helmut Werner, chief executive officer of Daimler Benz AG's unit Mercedes-Benz AG told a news conference on Monday.</p>
</text>
